From: Tom Care <tcare@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Jul 2025 14:41:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/63] Add vhost-user and vhost-user vsock support (except
 rust crates)

Summary: Cuttlefish side changes to support vhost-user vsock on mac.

Test Plan:
- Add a lot of debug logging
- Update epoll
- Fix temp paths for sockets to fit mac limits
- Add mac inotify and test
- Remove crosvm limitations
- Small image generation fixes

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: achong, olja, benthomas, <internal-group>_configuration

Reviewed By: achong

Subscribers: ryanyu

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D80563549

Tags: <internal-group>_configuration, <internal-group>
